9: This React hook returns visit information if the patient UUID is not null. There are
10: potentially two relevant visits at a time: "active" and "current".
11: 
12: The active visit is the most recent visit without an end date. The presence of an active
13: visit generally means that the patient is in the facility.
14: 
15: The current visit is the active visit, unless a retrospective visit has been selected.
