17: current visit. If there is no active visit but there is a retrospective visit, then
18: the retrospective visit is the current visit. `currentVisitIsRetrospective` tells you
19: whether the current visit is a retrospective visit.
20: 
21: The active visit and current visit require two separate API calls. `error` contains
22: the error from either one, if there is an error. `isValidating` is true if either
23: API call is in progress. `mutate` refreshes the data from both API calls.
